SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE AND FORMAL IMPLEMENTATION SPECIFICATION\
Document ID: ADA-2026-ULTIMATE-SILICON-SPEC\
Classification: Mission-Critical / Mathematically Verified / Hardware-Agnostic x64\
Status: Absolute Final Specification for Deterministic x86-64 Execution\
