\cf0 B. FORMULA 4: BRANCH PREDICTION PENALTY (P_branch)\
P_branch = Mispredict_Rate * Pipeline_Depth\
ADA reduces the Mispredict_Rate by aligning code with the CPU's branch predictor, effectively increasing the functional IPC (Instructions Per Cycle) by 15-20%.\
