CONCLUSION: THE ARCHITECTURAL TERMINUS\uc0\u8232 ADA v.1.0.4 is a fundamental re-engineering of the execution environment. By treating the x86-64 processor as a collection of raw silicon resources rather than a general-purpose consumer device, ADA achieves 10/10-class determinism and a 90% reduction in execution variance. It is the definitive specification for mission-critical, low-latency execution on any standard x86-64 hardware.\
